Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon,\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the wave, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop Chop Chop Chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop Chop Chop Chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you ever read the W .E .J.?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The World Economic Journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a major paper, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They used to run this awesome comic strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was called Saru, Warrior of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Had a giant robot and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't miss it for my life, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Saru was this hero who\Ncould walk on water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a transforming robot\Nand a little Skull pal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the bad guys, the evil armies of Germa\Ndouble six, enemies to all marines, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,People all over the world love that comic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it looks like a kid's story on\Nthe surface, but from what I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it was actually based on true reports\Nfrom the big shot Navy heroes, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's pretty much propaganda,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,teaching the little kiddies that the Navy\Nis always right and always wins the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lili. Lo, lo, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So why would a guy like me read\Na comic like that, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why for the villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For Germa double six!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Their armies used every dirty trick in\Nthe book to try and pull one over on Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They were a role model\Nfor outlaws like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that Germa has to lose\Nfor the sake of the story,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I always cheered for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to do\Nwith them, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you as a fan in fact I could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hardly wait to meet the\Nrest of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Little then fanboy over them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,instead—are you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna open or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as I was just saying, would\Nyou stop following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my room, you weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be my room\Ntoo, so why am I in a cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a genius scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve better treatment than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been crying about\Nthis all day, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we were told to\Ncapture you, not pamper you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sanji here—he's the\Ngroom that's gonna bring the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke family and the\NCharlotte family together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you may be a genius,\Nbut he's still worth more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,worth more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't nobody disrespects my boy Vito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now apologize for your dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't hurt my feelings at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean thanks for\Nsticking up for me buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he was just playing around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, get the hell out\Nof my room right now. Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult me, but don't insult my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to be pals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate your guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't leave, I've\Ngot more insults for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, you do realize that he's one\Nof the Vinsmoke family, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lay so much as a finger on him,\Nthen my veggie's head is gonna roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though while we're at it, maybe I should\Nlop your head off first, you dumb-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be nice from now on, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With punishment, there's\Nno dinner for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lili, sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk about Janet later, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I might melt before I starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Saji back on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need some ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take off my fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not helping right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Minx have a low tolerance for heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.42,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't cool off soon, I fear\NI'm going to become a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, a mummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I become a mommy, that would\Nbe like an upgrade for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a fancy sarcophagus,\Nthen could I see your panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had the strength to slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, I'm hungry and\Nit's hot and I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some nutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had such bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been too stormy\Nfor us to fish at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the sun's killing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's hot, but please catch\Nsomething while we still have clear skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll all starve to\Ndeath before we even get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, team food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're giving it our best, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually so hot that\Nthe water is boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, that's a no on the fish, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolf! Pull! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Freddy, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all cheering for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy, keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we might not die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, Fischity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that should be quite the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going in my belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that color is a bad sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fish that eats food!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can look it up before we cook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with the saucy ladies already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want an encyclopedia of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this one. Oh, come on. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't eat the skin of that fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Extremely poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji made a note about it in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the skin's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you're hungry,\Nbut wait for me to grill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Kara, you should try\Nsome, too! I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awfully slimy. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, dinner's served!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, that's music to my\Nears! I'm famished. Eat out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an awesome cook, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the tears, they won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so alive! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Such joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just followed Sanji's\Nrecipe, so don't thank me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, eat something\Nbefore you pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Boobie's doing bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so, so cold, Chopper. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying isn't gonna save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some fish to get\Nthat brain working again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know you'll come up\Nwith a plan to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if I can't stop\Ncrying, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I already used up all of our antidotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta find an island, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it easier to find land?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked at Sanji's notes myself,\Nand according to his book,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the poison from the skin\Nshould kill you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't react at all till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though he's\Nsick, he's still not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should have more\Nfaith in Luffy's vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, but look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you, Tia, gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The river, it's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, he's at the river stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to enter Mama's\Nterritory any moment now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll run into a bunch\Nof smaller islands with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.06,0:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the defense network\Nsurrounding Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there's no reason for Blackleg and\Nhis little entourage to get held up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,he's probably reached\NWhole Cake Island already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, don't lower your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go keep a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I had planned to stop at\Nthe first island ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We can find an antidote there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hot and now it's snowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those sugar clouds? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We call this a cotton candy flurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're giving a call? Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're hearing is a warning signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've entered Mama's territory, and\Nher troops are going to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hider, disguise yourselves as something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something! Pec-Oms!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get here so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're one of Mama's scout ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make it out through the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You go hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this mess somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Ubi's condition is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The poison is spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.48,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he can hold on much\Nlonger without some kind of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll have\Nsomething on the scout ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, but you've got to\Nhide right now! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chopper, double time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a transponder, snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that number could mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat Luffy's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't look, it's Germa Double Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not Big Mom after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They call Germa Double Six the warmongers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do you have in these waters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to hit their ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the sails!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we avoided a crash, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That curly eyebrow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be him! What? Really? We did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't believe that\Nwe found Sanji so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, we have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy ate some poisoned\Nfish and he's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have an antidote\Non that big ship, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's urgent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, can't you hear me? Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we might look alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But my name is Yonji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yonji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's got curly eyebrows, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's not Sanji, then\Nwho in the heck's Yonji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My relationship with your associate\NSanji is a highly classified matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret that I'll\Ntake to the grave with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his younger brother for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder who else is in his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know they're related?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yonji, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to interrupt, but I don't think\Nwe'll find Master Sanji on that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we missed each\Nother on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pull back, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yonji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's developing a rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Luffy has strong antibodies, so\Nthis poison must be really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a poison from\Na stupid fish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to be king of\Nthe pirates, then fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We used all of our antidotes on him, but\Nhis condition just keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, can you\Ndo it for Sanji at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your brother's captain die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not into the whole saving lives thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want that medicine so\Nbad, why don't you take it from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are pirates, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He only has Sanji's bad parts\Nand none of the good ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a playboy jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you, Tia, being so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say the word and he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunji. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so stinging, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, Pia? An enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rather heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A creep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.36,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But never mind, my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you related to Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got curly eyebrows, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He flies? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking\Nhumiliating me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Buffoon, you should be\Nashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wonder how he's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.74,0:24:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's technology. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.44,0:24:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're powerful, don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.50,0:24:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but the strength of\NGerman double six is the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.30,0:24:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,strength of science you\Nmight call them a scientific
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,fighting squad that's\Nwhy mama's interested
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,she wants that technology
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for herself back homes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that name rings a bell\Nif I recall Vinsmoke was
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.46,0:24:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the name of a royal\Nfamily many years ago they
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,conquered the north blue\Ni believe and they did
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so with an overwhelming\Nshow of military might
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,royalty like vivi or like neptune's family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.94,0:24:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so they're actually\Nreally famous that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.08,0:24:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,their name was synonymous\Nwith evil in fact
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,in a comic strip they\Nwere used as villains i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.87,0:25:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a regular historian.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.10,0:25:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been alive for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And dead as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.94,0:25:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it's not just a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.90,0:25:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For even still, we are royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.26,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa is a nation without soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We own no territory, but we are given the\Nright to attend the reverie all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,May I see your royal panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Most honored lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind, I'll\Nbe taking that from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to guess he ate the skin of an\Narmored stonefish from the boiling sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This poison has very particular effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite the glutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a giant wouldn't survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.61,0:26:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But there has to be some way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.20,0:26:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the worst doctor in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.30,0:26:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This poison is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.96,0:26:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Down the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.12,0:26:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you suck out that\Npoison, you'll die for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.46,0:26:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could trade places with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, alas, my lips are long gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The rash is transferring?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.92,0:27:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.56,0:27:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You sucked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Never felt better,\Nbecause I'm Poison Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a code name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, delicious. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.04,0:28:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bluefeet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.82,0:28:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you had got her for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.22,0:28:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.68,0:28:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did I fall asleep while\NI was eating that giant fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The skin part was really\Ngood! Is there any left? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.38,0:28:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Soji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.68,0:28:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:28:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, she's the person\Nwho just saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.34,0:29:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.25,0:29:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.38,0:29:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.26,0:29:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the infamous Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.58,0:29:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew Sanji had a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.49,0:29:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.41,0:29:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is a Vinsmoke like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was separated from\Nus when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our father's been searching\Nfor him for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,About two years ago, when Sanji's\Nwanted poster was first circulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.56,0:29:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My father personally requested that\Nthe Navy make catching him a priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.34,0:29:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, they pursued a man\Nnamed Devil by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the guy from the Flying Fish Riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We met him right before\Nwe went to Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.24,0:29:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sanji was not a\Nfan of that whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.76,0:29:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't until recently that the\Ngovernment finally ironed things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When your crew made\Nyour surprise comeback,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they captured an image of\NSanji during the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.26,0:30:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, they gave us a\Ncall to share the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, our father raised\NSanji's bounty immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the dead or\Nalive, that was no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was changed to\Nsay only alive instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew there was something behind\Nthat, but we couldn't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay so where's Sanji right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say he could be with Big Mom\Nor he could be with our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought we might catch him on\Nthe way, but we were too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well we'll see him at the tea party,\Nand that's the important part!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be long now,\Nand I even got to meet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You took good care of Sanji for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji sister
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.70,0:31:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving my\Nlife for real, but still
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.20,0:31:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking Sanjuvac.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my Gourmet, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.54,0:31:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.54,0:31:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.14,0:32:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't save your enemy's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.36,0:32:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Peckham's from the\NBig Mom Pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.58,0:32:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So what the hell are you doing\Nhanging out with the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons, and\Nthat's all I'm gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.52,0:32:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no obligation to\Nexplain it to you get out
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.98,0:32:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Things might be different after this\Nwedding ceremony, but right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just some random guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.82,0:32:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't argue with that
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.12,0:32:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For the time being, at least now,\Npretend this meeting never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.96,0:32:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call—our mistake for\Nbutting in, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.60,0:32:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to cause any trouble\Nand put the wedding in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.56,0:32:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,jeopardy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd recommend you tread lightly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have some sense! Get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.44,0:32:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the anchor. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.52,0:33:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.43,0:33:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.30,0:33:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran into Germa, but it\Nseems they avoided a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.16,0:33:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure it's their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.12,0:33:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can confirm that Straw\NHat Luffy is on board, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.68,0:33:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.52,0:33:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei...
